Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): add conservative self-work risk and stable
 sampling policy [daveey]

Keep dispatcher, credentials, pacing/quota and money paths on independent review and mandatory verification. Prove ordinary tests and guard comments using complete patches; sample ordinary merged fixes by stable seeded repository/SHA hash with one reversible config key. State shipping and sweep consumers land separately; these pure helpers alone do not authorize a merge.

Proof: 153 focused risk, sampling and docs tests passed; scripts/check --base origin/main passed. Complete Git adapter composition verified separately. Main lacks these helpers; behavioral baseline refusal is reproduced by the coordinated state review-gate test.
